-- Target aliases (ex5). Twin of 005-target-aliases.bqn.
-- Five entities under the host's pointing finger: ^cursor hovers row 2, ^observer watches row 1, ^selected boxes rows 2 and 3, and row 0 is the Player. Deixis, resolved to masks.
-- Aliases are ordinary predicates with short names, resolved per evaluation; ^selected is deliberately non-singleton (rows 2, 3). *= 2 down a mask is v×1+mask, never gather/multiply/scatter with a scalar.
--! registry ../registries/005-target-aliases.reg
--! expect health = 50 60 0 80 90
--! expect faction = None Friendly None None None
--! expect gold = 10000 2 3 4 5
--! expect damage = 10 20 60 80 50

^cursor , Health = 0
^observer , Faction = :Friendly
Player , Gold += 9999
^selected , Damage *= 2
